[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13680.67, "timestamp": "03:48:00", "text": "是 GP Chama。我还能说什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13684.51, "timestamp": "03:48:04", "text": "你？我的天啊。这是卡哇伊面包"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13687.59, "timestamp": "03:48:07", "text": "查玛。他现在怎么样了？你好吗，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13690.469, "timestamp": "03:48:10", "text": "布伦娜？哦，等等。那把枪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13691.469, "timestamp": "03:48:11", "text": "看起来如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13694.63, "timestamp": "03:48:14", "text": "好的。顺便说一句，这把枪看起来真棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13696.429, "timestamp": "03:48:16", "text": "这是事件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13700.6, "timestamp": "03:48:20", "text": "枪。哇，这太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13722.67, "timestamp": "03:48:42", "text": "著名的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13725.55, "timestamp": "03:48:45", "text": "我。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13728.15, "timestamp": "03:48:48", "text": "意思是，出名也好，什么的，都无关紧要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.349, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13734.15, "timestamp": "03:48:54", "text": "结尾。哦，是的。我确实有这种感觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13737.11, "timestamp": "03:48:57", "text": "其实你知道，接下来要聊的就是这个话题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13738.91, "timestamp": "03:48:58", "text": "关于这个"}]